{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:59:10+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:59:10+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Laboratorios Farmaceuticos Rovi, S.A.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"Spain","city":"Pozuelo de Alarcón","website":"https://www.rovi.es","employees":2470,"summary":"Laboratorios Farmaceuticos Rovi, S.A. manufactures, sells, and markets pharmaceutical products in Spain, European Union, OECD countries, and internationally. The company offers prescription products, including Ameride, Bertanel, Bluxam, Enoxaparin Rovi, Calcium Vitamine D3 Rovi, Exxiv, Prinvil, Rhodogil, Glufan, Hibor, Hirobriz Breezhaler, Neparvis, Mysimba, Orvatez, Tryptizol, Ulunar Breezhaler, and Volutsa. It also provides hospital products, such as Iomeron and Iopamiro, Multihance and Y Prohance, Sonovue, Empowercta+, Empowermr, and CT Express; catheter care under the Fibrilin brand; and Sodium Heparin Rovi. In addition, the company offers contract-manufacturing services comprising compounding, sterile filling and terminal sterilisation, inspection, installation of safety devices, labelling, packaging, serialisation and aggregation, for different injectable pharmaceutical forms, such as prefilled syringes, vials and cartridges, as well as manufacturing and packaging services for solid products. Further, it offers low-molecular-weight heparin, Okedi, and Rolcya; and develops Letrozole SIE and Risperidone QUAR. Its products are used for cardiology, osteoarticular/women's health, anesthesia /pain, diagnostic imaging contrast agents, central nervous system, urology, endocrinology, respiratory, and primary healthcare areas. The company was incorporated in 1946 and is headquartered in Pozuelo de Alarcón, Spain. Laboratorios Farmaceúticos Rovi, S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Norbel Inversiones, S.L.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Laboratorios Farmaceuticos Rovi, S.A. fabrique, vend et commercialise des produits pharmaceutiques en Espagne, dans l’Union européenne, dans les pays de l’OCDE et à l’international. La société propose des produits de prescription, y compris Ameride, Bertanel, Bluxam, Enoxaparin Rovi, Calcium Vitamine D3 Rovi, Exxiv, Prinvil, Rhodogil, Glufan, Hibor, Hirobriz Breezhaler, Neparvis, Mysimba, Orvatez, Tryptizol, Ulunar Breezhaler et Volutsa. Il fournit également des produits hospitaliers, tels que Iomeron et Iopamiro, Multihance et Y Prohance, Sonovue, Empowercta +, Empowermr et CT Express; soins par cathéter sous la marque Fibrilin; et Sodium Heparin Rovi."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3040458752,"shares_outstanding":51143123,"trailing_pe":16.422653,"forward_pe":18.084421,"price_to_book":4.3397326,"ev_to_ebitda":17.082,"ev_to_revenue":3.888,"dividend_yield":0.0163,"payout_ratio":0.2583,"beta_yahoo":0.265},"targets":{"current_price":59.45,"mean":73.24444,"median":74.0,"high":83.0,"low":64.2,"n_analysts":9,"reco_mean":2.22222,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":220700000,"ex_dividend":"2026-07-13","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.68197,"institutions_pct":0.1664,"institutions_float_pct":0.52323,"institutions_n":150,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Discovery Fd.","pct":0.0109,"shares":559980,"value":33290811,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.025899999},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0047999998,"shares":244917,"value":14560315,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0414},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0032,"shares":161441,"value":9597667,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0058},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.003,"shares":156016,"value":9275151,"date":"2026-08-3